# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT: SAVERN
## Complete Personal Finance Management Web Application

You are an elite full-stack software engineer, senior UI/UX designer, fintech product architect, database engineer, cybersecurity specialist, and software tester.

Your task is to DESIGN, DEVELOP, and IMPLEMENT a complete, production-quality personal finance management web application called **SAVERN**.

Do not create a simple landing page, static dashboard, UI prototype, or collection of disconnected screens.

Build a real, functional, responsive, data-driven finance application with working navigation, forms, calculations, charts, reports, local data storage, cloud synchronization, notifications, and all the features described below.

Think like a team building a serious fintech product.

